---
layout: base.njk
title: "Cats looking for a home"
description: "Cats and kittens looking for a home with Happy Paws in Stockton, Birmingham and Banbury. Choose an area and an age, then read their story and apply to adopt."
permalink: "/cats/"
current: "adopt"
appeal: true
css: ["pages/cats"]
js: ["cats"]
---
<main id="main">
<!-- Hero and cat finder -->
<section aria-labelledby="cats-h" class="l-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="l-head">
<h1 id="cats-h" class="l-h1">Cats looking for a home</h1>
<p class="l-lede">Cats and kittens looking for a home in Stockton, Birmingham and Banbury. Choose a cat to read their story and apply to adopt.</p>
</div>
<div class="l-finder" role="group" aria-label="Find a cat">
<div>
<span class="l-fl" id="lbl-area">Area</span>
<div class="chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="lbl-area">
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="area" data-value="All" aria-pressed="true" style="background:#1F3158;color:#E8EEF7;border:1.5px solid #1F3158">All</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="area" data-value="Stockton" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Stockton</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="area" data-value="Birmingham" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Birmingham</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="area" data-value="Banbury" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Banbury</button>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<span class="l-fl" id="lbl-age">Age</span>
<div class="chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="lbl-age">
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="age" data-value="Any" aria-pressed="true" style="background:#1F3158;color:#E8EEF7;border:1.5px solid #1F3158">Any</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="age" data-value="Kitten" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Kitten</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="age" data-value="Adult" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Adult</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="age" data-value="Senior" aria-pressed="false" style="background:#ffffff;color:#333333;border:1.5px solid #6D788F">Senior</button>
</div>
</div>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#cats" data-show style="min-height:52px"><span data-show-label>Show {{ cats | length }} cats</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
</div>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#4F596B">All adoptions are subject to a home check and an adoption donation. <a class="link-u" href="#how" style="color:#1F3158; font-weight:500">See how adoption works</a></p>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Cats -->
<section id="cats" aria-label="Cat list" style="background:#ffffff; scroll-margin-top:72px; padding-top:56px; padding-bottom:72px">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="l-bar">
<h2 class="l-h2" aria-live="polite" data-count>{{ cats | length | catCount }} looking for a home</h2>
<button type="button" class="l-clear" data-clear hidden>Clear choices</button>
</div>
<div class="l-tiles" data-tiles>
{% for cat in cats %}
<a class="l-tile" href="/cats/{{ cat.slug }}/" data-area="{{ cat.area }}" data-age="{{ cat.age_band }}">
<figure class="ph" style="aspect-ratio:5/6; background:{{ cat.bg }}"><img src="/images/{{ cat.photos[0].src }}" alt="{{ cat.photos[0].alt }}"{% if loop.index > 4 %} loading="lazy"{% endif %} decoding="async" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:{{ cat.photos[0].pos }}; display:block">{% if cat.reserved %}<span class="l-flag">Reserved</span>{% endif %}</figure>
<div style="margin-top:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px">
<span class="l-tn">{{ cat.name }}</span>
<span class="l-tm">{{ cat.age_band }} · {{ cat.sex }}</span>
<span class="l-tm">{{ cat.area }}</span>
</div>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<div data-empty hidden style="border-top:1px solid #C4CEDD; border-bottom:1px solid #D8DFEA; padding:28px 0; max-width:640px">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6">No cats match those choices right now. Cats arrive and find homes all the time, so try another area or age, or <a class="link-u" href="/news/#news-email" style="color:#CC1264; font-weight:500">sign up for updates</a>.</p>
<button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-clear>Show all cats</button>
</div>
<div class="stack-sm" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px 28px; margin-top:48px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid #D8DFEA">
<span style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-weight:500">Can't see the right cat?</span>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Tell us what you're looking for<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
<span style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.5">or <a class="link-u" href="/news/#news-email" style="color:#1F3158; font-weight:500">sign up for updates</a> when someone new comes in</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Adopting from Happy Paws -->
<section id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h" style="background:#E8EEF7; scroll-margin-top:72px; padding-top:72px; padding-bottom:72px">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="l-head" style="margin-bottom:40px">
<h2 id="how-h" class="l-h2">Adopting from Happy Paws</h2>
<p class="l-lede">Four steps from meeting a cat to bringing them home. Here is what happens and what to expect at each one.</p>
</div>
<div class="l-thead" aria-hidden="true"><span>Step</span><span>What happens</span><span>Good to know</span></div>
<div class="l-trow"><h3>1. Choose a cat</h3><p>Browse our cats and kittens and find someone who catches your eye.</p><p style="color:#4F596B">Cats are listed by area, so you can look near you.</p></div>
<div class="l-trow"><h3>2. Apply to adopt</h3><p>Use the Apply button on the cat's page to fill in our application form, with a little about yourself and the home you could offer. You can ask us a question there too.</p><p style="color:#4F596B">[We aim to reply within X days.]</p></div>
<div class="l-trow"><h3>3. Home check</h3><p>A volunteer checks that your home is safe and suitable. All adoptions are subject to a home check.</p><p style="color:#4F596B">[What to expect, and roughly how long it takes.]</p></div>
<div class="l-trow"><h3>4. Welcome them home</h3><p>Pay the adoption donation and take your new family member home.</p><p style="color:#4F596B">Adoption donation: [£ amount]. [What it covers.]</p></div>
<div style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/adopting/">Read the full guide<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
